# Vila Dea product

Two apps, one product. Do not merge them by moving the React tree.

- Frontend: this workspace (`Reception application in Albanian`).
- Backend: sibling `../vila-dea-backend` (latest Laravel, currently 13, PHP 8.3+, MySQL `vila_dea`).
- Follow the HoReCa rules copied into `.cursor/rules/`: Managers, `ApiTrait`, `HasMessages`, pipeline list filters, API Resources, `messages.*` in `lang/en` and `lang/sq`. Do not put business logic in controllers or models.

The approved React screens, SCSS modules, and Albanian copy stay. Do not replace them with an admin template.

UI text is Albanian. Database columns, PHP, TypeScript, and API field names that are not operator copy stay English.

Availability and double-booking are enforced in Laravel (`ReservationService` + row lock), not in the calendar. A direct stay commits before `SyncAvailabilityJob`. Channel calls go through `App\Contracts\ChannelProvider` only. Do not add Channex or Beds24 clients in Milestone 1.

Read `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/DOMAIN.md`, `docs/API.md`, `docs/DECISIONS.md`, and `docs/CHANNEL_SYNC.md` before changing reservations, rooms, or sync.

When a domain or API decision changes, update the matching doc in the same change.
